    {
     "t": "event-field",
     "field": "datetime",
     "text": "August 17, 2024\n@ 3:00 pm\n- 5:00 pm"
    },
    {
     "t": "image",
     "ref": "assets/source/3b8b11ca-Regenerative-Logo_200px.png",
     "srcUrl": "https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Regenerative-Logo_200px.png?lossy=2&strip=0&webp=1",
     "alt": "Regenerative, LLC",
     "w": 200,
     "h": 188,
     "kind": "event-image"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Join us for the Regenerative, LLC Pop-Up event to learn more about Kosmik, Cultivators Classic (CClassic) and Uncut brands and their products offered such as gummies, concentrates, vapes and more."
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Regenerative, LLC"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>The name Regenerative stems from the pursuit of growing in true living soil also known as regenerative farming. As a result, the difference in the quality of their product cannot be understated – the combination of organic practices, sun-grown, and directly in soil is truly the way cannabis was meant to be grown.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><img src=\"assets/source/b4da85f9-kosmik-cclassic-uncut-banner-1024x147.jpg\" alt=\"Kosmik, CClassic and Uncut Brands\" width=\"1024\" height=\"147\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/kosmik-cclassic-uncut-banner-1024x147.jpg?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\"></p><p><a href=\"/brands/kosmik-brands/\"><strong>Click here to shop Kosmik products!</strong></a></p><p><a href=\"/brands/cclassic/\"><strong>Click here to shop Cultivators Classic products!</strong></a></p><p><a href=\"/brands/uncut/\"><strong>Click here to shop Uncut products!</strong></a></p>"
    },
